        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa\n- Places: Nayarit, Mexico\n- Systems: a waterway dam\n- Topics: waterways in Nayarit\n\nFacts:\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa served as President of Mexico from 2006 to 2012.\n- A dam on a waterway in Nayarit, Mexico was completed on July 30, 2012.\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa inaugurated that dam.\n- The waterway is one of the biggest in Nayarit, Mexico.\n- The Mololoa River is another of the biggest waterways in Nayarit, Mexico.",
